sequenceDiagram
  actor St as Student
  participant UI as Browser (app.js)
  participant API as Express server
  participant JR as joinRules.js
  participant DB as SQLite
  St->>UI: clicks "Join as volunteer"
  UI->>API: POST /api/projects/2/join {role:"volunteer"} + cookie
  API->>DB: find session token → user
  API->>DB: project, existing request, accepted counts, schedule
  API->>JR: checkJoinRequest({...})
  JR-->>API: {ok:true} or {ok:false, status, reason}
  alt allowed
    API->>DB: INSERT membership (pending)
    API-->>UI: 201 {message}
    UI-->>St: green message, page redrawn
  else refused
    API-->>UI: 409 {error: reason}
    UI-->>St: red message with the reason
  end
